Project notice:

RadixSwift is an independent native Swift and SwiftUI port of Radix UI concepts
for macOS applications. It ports Radix-inspired Themes, Primitives, Icons, and
Colors into one Swift Package so other native macOS projects can use it as a UI
layer dependency.

This package includes generated data and bundled resources derived from
MIT-licensed Radix UI repositories. Radix UI is maintained by WorkOS and the
Radix UI contributors. RadixSwift is not an official WorkOS or Radix UI
distribution unless separately stated. See NOTICE.md for upstream attribution.
